		{
			"title"		"Touchscreen Mouse Emulation"
			"description"		"This template is for point and click/management games. You might need to adjust bindings if there are additional hotkeys the game expects. Dpad controls the touchscreen mode L/L,Down/MiddleMouse,R/R,Up/Hover. A is Enter and B is escape. Left trackpad or bumpers are mouse scrollwheel and right trackpad/joystick are fallback mouse. L/R trigger are mouse clicks"
		}
